<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>If any provision of this chapter or the application thereof to any person or circumstance is held unconstitutional, such invalidity shall not affect other provisions or applications of this chapter which can be given effect without the invalid provision or application, and to this end the provisions of this chapter are severable.</p></caml:Content>